onship, despite decades of talent, deep playoff runs, and near misses.","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://en.albat.com/lista/nba-teams-without-a-ring-10-franchises-still-chasing-a-titlewho-breaks-through-next-20260420-0045.html"},"url":"https://en.albat.com/lista/nba-teams-without-a-ring-10-franchises-still-chasing-a-titlewho-breaks-through-next-20260420-0045.html","inLanguage":"en-US","datePublished":"2026-04-20T15:23:46-0700","dateModified":"2026-04-20T15:23:46-0700","headline":"NBA teams without a ring: 10 franchises still chasing a titlewho breaks through next?","image":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703549093/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/gemini_generated_image_kcf4ghkcf4ghkcf4.jpg_2062789929.jpg","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703549093/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/gemini_generated_image_kcf4ghkcf4ghkcf4.jpg_462530703.jpg","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703549093/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/gemini_generated_image_kcf4ghkcf4ghkcf4.jpg_1269359182.jpg"],"author":[{"@type":"Person","url":"https://en.albat.com/staff/jonathanriniti","name":"Jonathan Riniti"}],"wordCount":208,"articleSection":"Breaking","articleBody":" Winning an NBA championship is the ultimate measure of greatness, yet not every franchise gets there. While dynasties dominate headlines, several teams continue to chase history. From heartbreaking Finals losses to missed opportunities, these organizations remain ringless—but not without moments of promise.,One of the oldest franchises without even a Finals appearance, the Clippers’ best shot came in 2021 but ended in the Western Conference Finals.,With Finals appearances in 2000 and 2025, Indiana has come close, but still hasn’t captured an NBA championship despite its ABA legacy.,The “Grit and Grind” era pushed Memphis deep into the playoffs, but they’ve never reached the Finals.,Two Finals trips in the early 2000s and a failed superteam era leave Brooklyn wondering what could have been.,Back-to-back Finals losses in the late 90s against Chicago remain their closest shot at a title.,Despite multiple Conference Finals appearances, Minnesota has never reached the NBA Finals.,Without sustained superstar continuity, the Pelicans have struggled to build a true contender.,Finals runs in 1995 and 2009 ended in defeat, leaving Orlando still chasing its first title.,Charlotte has yet to reach a Conference Finals, making its title drought one of the most persistent.,With three Finals appearances, including a painful 2021 collapse, Phoenix holds the record for most Finals trips without a championship.","keywords":"NBA","publisher":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Al Bat Baseball","url":"https://en.albat.com","sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/albatbaseball","http://twitter.com/albatbaseball","https://instagram.com/albatbaseball/","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_1S2PfO6KKOFdZGOgeqeFQ","https://news.google.com/publications/CAAqJggKIiBDQklTRWdnTWFnNEtER1Z1TG1Gc1ltRjBMbU52YlNnQVAB"],"logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__public/9d669626bbf6c2660/_sites/albaten/social/schema-publisher.png","width":600,"height":60}}}</script><script data-testid="google-tag-manager-head">
