</div></div></div></div></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"article":{"id":"|pasionbeisbolera_en|lista|2026|04|20|lista_0045.html","type":"news","format":"standard","date":{"published":1776723826000,"created":1776723826000,"modified":1776723826000,"visual":1776723780000},"section":{"id":"breaking","name":"Breaking","slug":"/seccion/breaking","link":"/seccion/breaking"},"canonical":"https://en.albat.com/lista/nba-teams-without-a-ring-10-franchises-still-chasing-a-titlewho-breaks-through-next-20260420-0045.html","link":"/lista/nba-teams-without-a-ring-10-franchises-still-chasing-a-titlewho-breaks-through-next-20260420-0045.html","title":"NBA teams without a ring: 10 franchises still chasing a titlewho breaks through next?","subtitle":"\u003cp\u003eA sharp U.S.-style breakdown of NBA franchises that have never won a championship, despite decades of talent, deep playoff runs, and near misses.\u003c/p\u003e","preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"NBA teams without a ring: 10 franchises still chasing a title—who breaks through next?","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703549093/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/gemini_generated_image_kcf4ghkcf4ghkcf4.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703549093/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/gemini_generated_image_kcf4ghkcf4ghkcf4.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703549093/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/gemini_generated_image_kcf4ghkcf4ghkcf4.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"NBA teams without a ring: 10 franchises still chasing a title—who breaks through next?","priority":true,"responsive":null}],"list":[{"title":"NBA teams without a ring: 10 franchises still chasing a title—who breaks through next?","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"Winning an NBA championship is the ultimate measure of greatness, yet not every franchise gets there. While dynasties dominate headlines, several teams continue to chase history. From heartbreaking Finals losses to missed opportunities, these organizations remain ringless—but not without moments of promise."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"NBA teams without a ring: 10 franchises still chasing a title—who breaks through next?","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703089111/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21j1ca_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703089111/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21j1ca_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703089111/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21j1ca_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"NBA teams without a ring: 10 franchises still chasing a title—who breaks through next?","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"10. Los Angeles Clippers — Still waiting for a Finals debut","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"One of the oldest franchises without even a Finals appearance, the Clippers’ best shot came in 2021 but ended in the Western Conference Finals."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"10. Los Angeles Clippers — Still waiting for a Finals debut","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703111685/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21j8hk_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703111685/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21j8hk_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703111685/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21j8hk_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"10. Los Angeles Clippers — Still waiting for a Finals debut","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"9. Indiana Pacers — Close, but no title","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"\u003cbr\u003eWith Finals appearances in 2000 and 2025, Indiana has come close, but still hasn’t captured an NBA championship despite its ABA legacy."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"9. Indiana Pacers — Close, but no title","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703130952/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21ieov_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703130952/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21ieov_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703130952/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21ieov_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"9. Indiana Pacers — Close, but no title","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"8. Memphis Grizzlies — Grit without glory","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"\u003cbr\u003eThe “Grit and Grind” era pushed Memphis deep into the playoffs, but they’ve never reached the Finals."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"8. Memphis Grizzlies — Grit without glory","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703150275/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21irhb_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703150275/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21irhb_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703150275/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21irhb_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"8. Memphis Grizzlies — Grit without glory","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"7. Brooklyn Nets — The biggest what-if","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"Two Finals trips in the early 2000s and a failed superteam era leave Brooklyn wondering what could have been."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"7. Brooklyn Nets — The biggest what-if","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703168702/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iw5e_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703168702/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iw5e_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703168702/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iw5e_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"7. Brooklyn Nets — The biggest what-if","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"6. Utah Jazz — Jordan denied them","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"\u003cbr\u003eBack-to-back Finals losses in the late 90s against Chicago remain their closest shot at a title."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"6. Utah Jazz — Jordan denied them","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703189691/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iygr_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703189691/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iygr_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703189691/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iygr_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"6. Utah Jazz — Jordan denied them","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"5. Minnesota Timberwolves — Still chasing history","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"Despite multiple Conference Finals appearances, Minnesota has never reached the NBA Finals."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"5. Minnesota Timberwolves — Still chasing history","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703209367/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iux9_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703209367/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iux9_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703209367/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iux9_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"5. Minnesota Timberwolves — Still chasing history","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"4. New Orleans Pelicans — Searching for stability","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"Without sustained superstar continuity, the Pelicans have struggled to build a true contender."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"4. New Orleans Pelicans — Searching for stability","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703230514/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21jsha_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703230514/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21jsha_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703230514/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21jsha_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"4. New Orleans Pelicans — Searching for stability","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"3. Orlando Magic — Twice denied","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"Finals runs in 1995 and 2009 ended in defeat, leaving Orlando still chasing its first title."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"3. Orlando Magic — Twice denied","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703250316/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iuxf_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703250316/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iuxf_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703250316/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21iuxf_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"3. Orlando Magic — Twice denied","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"2. Charlotte Hornets — Never past the second round","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"Charlotte has yet to reach a Conference Finals, making its title drought one of the most persistent."}}],"preview":[{"type":"image","caption":"2. Charlotte Hornets — Never past the second round","width":372,"height":209,"src":"https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703269280/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21ionh_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg","srcSet":["https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703269280/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21ionh_-1-.jpg_1085339914.jpg 372w","https://assets-en.albat.com/__export/1776703269280/sites/debate/img/2026/04/20/aa21ionh_-1-.jpg_554688468.jpg 1200w"],"alt":"2. Charlotte Hornets — Never past the second round","priority":null,"responsive":null}]},{"title":"1. Phoenix Suns — The closest without a ring","body":[{"key":"paragraph","props":{"value":"With three Finals appearances, including a painful 2021 collapse, Phoenix 